cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Parallel Hybrid Agent-Based Metaheuristic Optimization of
  Multi-Route Jeepney Networks Using Behavioral Simulation
message: If you use this software or its results, please cite the thesis below.
type: software
authors:
