    affiliation: MSU-Iligan Institute of Technology
repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/giosanchez0208/Jeepney-Route-System-Optimization
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A parallelized hybrid memetic algorithm for designing multi-route jeepney
  networks, coupling a population-level Genetic Algorithm with Ant Colony
  Optimization-inspired Lamarckian local search. Candidate networks are scored
  by a tick-by-tick agent-based commuter simulation calibrated on a local
  travel survey, and evaluated on a reconstructed representation of Iligan
  City, Philippines.
keywords:
  - transit network design
  - informal public transport
  - agent-based simulation
  - memetic algorithm
  - ant colony optimization
  - Lamarckian learning
  - paratransit
